## Send your booking request

The whole booking happens on the site — request, confirmation, then your Square deposit once a time is set. Coming from Instagram? DMs land in the same queue, or just fill this out and you'll hear back by text.
::

::form[submit="Send booking request"]
- Name (text) *
- Phone or Instagram (text) *
- Email (email)
- Artist (select: Sam Rose | Rae — her sister | Either) *
- Service (select: Consultation | Flash / Small Tattoo | Half-Day Session | Full-Day Session | Custom project) *
- Placement (text)
- Size (select: Small | Medium | Large | Full piece)
- Tattoo idea + reference links (textarea) *
- Preferred days & times (textarea) *
::

::callout[type=tip title="How support works: AI answers, human confirmation"]
The live site pairs an AI studio assistant with real-person escalation: routine questions — pricing, aftercare, healing, which days the chair is free — get an instant answer any hour, while anything custom (your design, a cover-up, a budget question) goes straight to Sam's phone. No matter what the assistant says, a human confirms every appointment before it's on the books. The assistant isn't wired up in this demo — for now, text 702-370-1380 or DM [@love222tattoo](https://instagram.com/love222tattoo).
::

::callout[type=note title="Demo — no payment taken online"]
Payments are disabled in this preview. On the live site, deposits run through Square the moment your time is confirmed — nothing is charged before that. Questions? Text 702-370-1380 or email [love222tattoo@gmail.com](mailto:love222tattoo@gmail.com).
::

